chatgpt-desktop
Version=26.1021.22027
Release=1

Synopsis:
Add the official ChatGPT desktop binary using its standard /usr layout.
Verify the upstream SHA-256 and extract only the Debian package payload.
Track stable amd64 releases with an override that updates the version, URL, and checksum.
TPM libraries are optional for remote-control device-key authentication.
